{"schema_version": 1, "segment_epoch": 1792061160, "covers_from": "2026-10-15T10:46:00+00:00", "covers_to": "2026-10-15T10:47:00+00:00", "next_epoch": 1792061220, "schedule": [{"starts_at": "2026-10-15T10:46:00+00:00", "duration_seconds": 6, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 49076, "sprite_key": "beaver_suburb", "district": "shilin", "topic": "公共安全", "content": "嚴格執行捷運不飲食的規則，不要有任何例外", "display_name": "士林代表 No.49,076", "mood": "angry", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-15T10:46:06+00:00", "duration_seconds": 15, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 22724, "sprite_key": "beaver_culture", "district": "daan", "topic": "城市修繕", "content": "每次鋪完路，不同單位來修地下管線，有東補一塊西補一塊，整條馬路凹凹凸凸的，如何成為國際成市？", "display_name": "大安代表 Charlie", "mood": "angry", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-15T10:46:21+00:00", "duration_seconds": 8, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 37673, "sprite_key": "leopardcat_suburb", "district": "shilin", "topic": "環境", "content": "從農會官網買的乖乖都還沒開就被老鼠整包啃掉了好生氣", "display_name": "士林代表 No.37,673", "mood": "angry", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-15T10:46:29+00:00", "duration_seconds": 15, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 49490, "sprite_key": "squirrel_culture", "district": "songshan", "topic": "交通", "content": "幹線公車可以減少尖峰時間的班距嗎？推廣進來搭乘捷運，不然路上好塞，要去沒捷運站的地方都塞到不行。", "display_name": "松山代表 No.49,490", "mood": "caring", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-15T10:46:44+00:00", "duration_seconds": 16, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 60491, "sprite_key": "bear_suburb", "district": "wenshan", "topic": "勞工", "content": "如果，你擔任市長，勞工退休金（純舊制）會不會依據勞基法辦理？\n如果不會，勞工該怎麼辦？", "display_name": "文山代表 No.60,491", "mood": "worried", "is_replay": true}], "queue": [{"position": 1, "queue_number": 22724, "sprite_key": "beaver_culture", "display_name": "大安代表 Charlie", "district": "daan", "is_replay": true, "frozen": true}, {"position": 2, "queue_number": 37673, "sprite_key": "leopardcat_suburb", "display_name": "士林代表 No.37,673", "district": "shilin", "is_replay": tru